4. RESTRICTIONS
================================================================================

Except as expressly permitted in section 2, you may not:

4.1  NO REDISTRIBUTION. Distribute the Software, any part of it, or any
     modified copy of it, to anyone - not as a file, not as a repack,
     not inside a user-interface bundle, not on another site, not
     behind a paywall and not behind an ad wall.

     The reason is not money. A copy that lives elsewhere is a copy
     that stops being updated, and the bug reports for it still arrive
     here.

4.2  NO DERIVED PUBLICATION. Publish, release or otherwise make
     available any Derived Work.

4.3  NO ASSET REUSE. Use the Software's status bar textures, its
     branding images, the name "Darken" or its mark in any other work.
     These are not covered by any permission in section 2.

4.4  NO SUBLICENSING OR TRANSFER. Sublicense, rent, lease, sell, assign
     or otherwise transfer the Software or your rights under this
     Licence.

4.5  NO REMOVAL OF NOTICES. Remove, obscure or alter any copyright
     notice, licence text, author credit or version information in the
     Software, including the fields of its TOC files.

4.6  NO MISREPRESENTATION. Present the Software, or any copy of it, as
     your own work, or present a modified copy as the Official Release.

4.7  NO CHARGING. Sell the Software, charge any fee for it, or put it
